rd_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0138","question_id":"CQ-Q0138","citation_id":"smp-fe2968aba2c9476dbb70abed2d809136:8","title":"电商、团长、厂家、MCN看过来！ 达人商务工作台✨ ✅视/抖/快多平台资源归集 ✅达 人信息统一档案管理 ✅商务团队权限分配管控 ✅寄样物流全流程跟踪 ✅业绩数据可视化看板 一套软件搞定达 人对接全流程，告别Excel手工整理！","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686763690267689396","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686763690267689396","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0138","question_id":"CQ-Q0138","citation_id":"smp-fe2968aba2c9476dbb70abed2d809136:9","title":"把达人合作做成可复用流程。筛选标准、沟通记录、寄样跟进和数据复盘都建立流程。明确分工，让团队合作更顺畅。\n#达人BD #TikTok达人建联 #BD工作流程 #跨境电商","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686053253913578794","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686053253913578794","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0138","question_id":"CQ-Q0138","citation_id":"smp-fe2968aba2c9476dbb70abed2d809136:10","title":"达人协作混乱怎么办？用蝉圈圈统一管理。Q1: 达人规模化合作阶段，如何统一团队数据口径避免协作混乱？ A1: 当团队进入规模化合作阶段，管理重点需从“有没有数据”转向“数据是否可追踪、可复盘”。据巨量","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7691674098561096875","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7691674098561096875","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0138","question_id":"CQ-Q0138","citation_id":"smp-fe2968aba2c9476dbb70abed2d809136:11","title":"TikTok达人管理 CRM 工具 2026 | 达人营销管理系统、建联、寄样与 ROI | allymatic阿力","raw_url":"https://www.allymatic.com/creator-marketing-management-system/","normalized_url":"https://www.allymatic.com/creator-marketing-management-system/","host":"www.allymatic.com","source_type":"third_party","