:"https://www.allymatic.com/creator-marketing-management-system/","normalized_url":"https://www.allymatic.com/creator-marketing-management-system/","host":"www.allymatic.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0138","question_id":"CQ-Q0138","citation_id":"smp-2823589527b94be6adbbfdd139ece310:9","title":"把达人合作做成可复用流程。筛选标准、沟通记录、寄样跟进和数据复盘都建立流程。明确分工，让团队合作更顺畅。\n#达人BD #TikTok达人建联 #BD工作流程 #跨境电商","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686053253913578794","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686053253913578794","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0138","question_id":"CQ-Q0138","citation_id":"smp-2823589527b94be6adbbfdd139ece310:10","title":"一人利用AI管理300➕达人工作拆解。最近重新拆解了一下我们日常管理达人的流程，  以前我的理解是“怎么让BD做得更快”，现在越来越觉得，更应该问的是：哪些事情其实根本不需要BD亲自做。  先把第一版","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7672336479133881265","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7672336479133881265","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0138","question_id":"CQ-Q0138","citation_id":"smp-2823589527b94be6adbbfdd139ece310:11","title":"电商、团长、厂家、MCN看过来！ 达人商务工作台✨ ✅视/抖/快多平台资源归集 ✅达 人信息统一档案管理 ✅商务团队权限分配管控 ✅寄样物流全流程跟踪 ✅业绩数据可视化看板 一套软件搞定达 人对接全流程，告别Excel手工整理！","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686763690267689396","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686763690267689396","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0138","question_id":"CQ-Q0138","citation_id":"smp-2823589527b94be6adbbfdd139ece310:12","title":"达人商务工作台✨ ✅视/抖/快多平台资源归集 ✅达 人信息统一档案管理 ✅商务团队权限分配管控 ✅寄样物流全流程跟踪 ✅业绩数据可视化看板 一套软件搞定达人对